    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pit of Gerstan is a roguelite dungeoneering action game. Hack, slash, throw and blast your way through hordes of enemies and bosses, as you collect various items, upgrades and weapons to create the ultimate dungeon-clearing hero. Build your own unique hero and playstyle while facing many enemies, hazards, secrets and bosses within the Pit of Gerstan! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972720/extras/0f09e0452b8aac7f1eee375e45f6661f.poster.avif?t=1731687513\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972720/extras/0f09e0452b8aac7f1eee375e45f6661f.webm?t=1731687513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1972720/extras/0f09e0452b8aac7f1eee375e45f6661f.mp4?t=1731687513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features Planned for Release</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Procedurally Generated Dungeons with many Secrets and Hazards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Characters with varied properties</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Challenging Bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ Weapons with their own properties and special abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">200 Unique Upgrades to craft your own Playstyle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Metaprogression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Seed System</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">More details to come.</p>",
